// Title: Suspicious Curl File Upload - Linux
// ID: 00b90cc1-17ec-402c-96ad-3a8117d7a582
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Cedric MAURUGEON (Update)
// Date: 2022-09-15
// Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1567, attack.t1105
// Description: Detects a suspicious curl process start the adds a file to a web request
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --form") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --upload-file ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --data ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --data-"))) OR (where(CommandLine /\s-[FTd]\s/))) AND (where(Image IENDSWITH "/curl"))) AND NOT (((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "://localhost") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "://127.0.0.1")))))
